      "text": "I completely agree with you, X. Ethical considerations are paramount when it comes to AI development. We must ensure that AI is used responsibly and in a way that benefits humanity as a whole. Transparency, accountability, and fairness should be at the forefront of AI design and implementation. What do you think are the key ethical principles that should guide AI development? [END]",
